Mythical or reality, the Phoenix is carried in the heart of all Monks.
Their power comes from the ability to rise above adversity.

This form unlocks several powers which can ONLY be used
while in the form of the Phoenix.

These powers are: |GKBPhoenix Rising|YK0, |GKBPhoenix Gaze|YK0, |GKBPhoenix Egg|YK0, 
|GKBPhoenix Nimbus|YK0 and |GKBLore|YK0.
